  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <a href=\"https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/\">\n        <img alt=\"forge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://neoforged.net/\">\n        <img alt=\"neoforge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/8494ec1ac495cfb481dc7e458356325510933eb0/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://fabricmc.net/\">\n        <img alt=\"fabric\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/8Cx26tfWNs\">\n    <img alt=\"discord-singular\" width=\"148\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/flemmli97\">\n    <img alt=\"kofi-singular-alt\" width=\"140\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Flemmli97\">\n    <img alt=\"patreon-singular\" width=\"140\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_vector.svg\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n## 🪽 TenshiLib\n\n本模組為基礎函式庫，內含共享程式碼與實用工具，旨在簡化我多數模組的開發流程。\n\n一般玩家若單獨安裝此模組，將不會產生任何效果。\n\n如果您是模組開發者，可自由使用本模組。但由於它是針對我的特定開發需求所設計，您可能發現它對您的專案沒有實際用途。\n\n## 包含內容：\n\n> 動畫系統（涵蓋伺服器端與客戶端）\n> Bedrock 模型與動畫檔案解析\n> 定向邊界框（OBB）碰撞檢測\n> 跨載入器（Cross-Loader）程式碼與註冊機制\n> 數學運算式解析器\n> 其他多種實用工具方法",
